 * @property {ChildNode[]} children child nodes
 * @property {boolean} selfClosing whether the element has no content model
 * @property {Namespace} namespace element namespace (0 HTML, 1 MathML, 2 SVG)
 * @property {number} end character offset of the element's closing position
